    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rollin' Garry",
    "steam_appid": 3704020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll Garry up the course dodging dangerous obstacles and traps with precision skill and timing in this exciting physics-based challenge platformer. Multiple paths are featured throughout the level to test strategic prowess and provide additional replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Challenge Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various bonus modes to enable new ways of playing and enjoying the gameplay experience. Players can create either a tougher challenge for themselves or to simply change the type of challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoint System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players can enable an optional checkpoint system for practicing their routes or for just creating an easier difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple High Score Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High scores are partitioned from each other based off of what settings the player has enabled. This allows high scores to be tracked separately depending on the particular run. Players should note, these are local high score systems as there is no online leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Garry Per Garry Than Any Other Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certified 120% Garry by the Council of Garry of Garry Affairs making this the most Garry per Garry game that has ever Garry'd.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll Garry up the course dodging dangerous obstacles and traps with precision skill and timing in this exciting physics-based challenge platformer. Multiple paths are featured throughout the level to test strategic prowess and provide additional replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Challenge Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various bonus modes to enable new ways of playing and enjoying the gameplay experience. Players can create either a tougher challenge for themselves or to simply change the type of challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoint System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players can enable an optional checkpoint system for practicing their routes or for just creating an easier difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple High Score Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High scores are partitioned from each other based off of what settings the player has enabled. This allows high scores to be tracked separately depending on the particular run. Players should note, these are local high score systems as there is no online leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Garry Per Garry Than Any Other Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certified 120% Garry by the Council of Garry of Garry Affairs making this the most Garry per Garry game that has ever Garry'd.</p>",
    "short_description": "A surprisingly difficult challenge platformer. Roll your way to the top in this easy to play, tough to master physics-based platformer. One mistake and Garry could be toast!",
